          "label": "C",
          "text": "\\(355\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "\\(454\\)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "step": "Any 3 of the points make a triangle: \\(^{15}C_{3} = \\dfrac{15 \\times 14 \\times 13}{6} = 455\\).",
      "checked": "15C3 = 2730/6 = 455 (2730 is 15P3, the ordered count). Matches the bank (A)."
