      "chapter": "Probability",
      "question": "Two fair dice are thrown. What is the probability that the sum is neither 5 nor 7?",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "\\(11/18\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "\\(2/3\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "\\(13/18\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "\\(5/6\\)"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "step": "Sum 5 in 4 ways, sum 7 in 6 ways: 10 of 36. The rest: \\(\\dfrac{26}{36} = \\dfrac{13}{18}\\).",
      "checked": "Sum 5: (1,4)(2,3)(3,2)(4,1) = 4; sum 7: 6; 36 − 10 = 26 → 26/36 = 13/18. Matches the bank (C)."
